    "description": "Alignment geometry (FDOT standard file ALGNRD): the alignments rebuilt from sheet 's centerlines, station ticks and station numbers, with stationing. FLH names the ORD feature ALI_<type>_<id> (ALI_MAIN_01); the alignment here keeps the name the plan letters. Local datum: the plan view's centre at E 10,000 N 10,000, view twist 0.0000 deg (the sample sheet prints no coordinates for its linework).",
